From b2e6ff316debeb0c4e0b6469f93c874ad20af1ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Apr 2026 00:42:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UX polish: mobile nav, unified gold token, accessibility,
 play overlays
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Design system (shared.css):
- Add --accent-gold/#C49A3C as single source of truth for gold accent
- Dark mode gold auto-adapts via --accent-gold override
- Add mobile hamburger menu with slide-out drawer
- Add .nav-drawer, .nav-overlay, .nav-hamburger components
- Add :focus-visible states using gold accent (buttons, nav links, toggle)
- Add .play-overlay component for inline video clips
- Add .nav-divider/.nav-label aliases for module page nav compatibility

All 12 pages:
- Add hamburger button + mobile drawer with all 5 nav links
- Add aria-current='page' to active nav link (desktop + drawer)
- Add toggleNav() JS for mobile menu open/close/overlay

Module pages (01-07):
- Replace hardcoded #b8922f/#d4a843 with var(--accent-gold)
- Add play overlay JS that injects centered play button on video clips

Inventory page:
- Replace --gold: #996f1a/#c9a44a with var(--accent-gold)

Assessments page:
- Replace progress bar #996f1a/#c9a44a with var(--accent-gold)

Landing page (system/index.html):
- Fix Google Fonts import: discrete weights → variable axis (400..680)
- Replace font-weight 500/600/700 with brand-spec 520/580/680
- Remove redundant --accent-gold redefinition (now from shared.css)
